    "scenesThatPass": [
      "TARA: You’ve reached Tara, why aren’t you texting me?\nSAM: Hey, you know you’re supposed to pick up when I call. I’m out of therapy early so we can cook dinner tonight if you want. See you soon!",
      "ANIKA: It doesn’t bother you? Being at a house party after you were almost brutally murdered at a house party?\nMINDY: I think of it like being struck by lightning. The odds of it happening to the same person twice are extremely low.\nANIKA: Guess I should stay close to you then.\nMINDY: Real close.",
      "ANIKA: I don’t love that...\nMINDY: Go.",
      "ANIKA: And I’m spectacularly uninterested in knowing anything about you. You’ve had too much, Tara.\nTARA: I’m not that bad, I swear. Thanks for checking on me.",
      "TARA: It means I’m not gonna let what happened to us for three days define the rest of my life.\nSAM: You’re pretending it didn’t happen at all-\nTARA: What are you doing here, Sam? In New York?\nTARA: You’re working two shitty jobs just to help with rent, but for what? What’s your plan?"
    ]
  },
